		"html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/>\n<title>Slanted coordinate grids</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n  body{\n    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    background:#eef2f7; color:#0f172a; padding:16px;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  .wrap{\n    max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:18px;\n    box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(15,23,42,.10), 0 2px 6px rgba(15,23,42,.06);\n    padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\n  }\n  .controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;}\n  .controls .spacer{flex:1 1 20px}\n  button{\n    font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;background:#f1f5f9;\n    border:1px solid #d7e0ea;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;\n    transition:background .15s,transform .05s,box-shadow .15s;\n  }\n  button:hover{background:#e6edf6}\n  button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}\n  button.on{background:#0f172a;color:#fff;border-color:#0f172a;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.25)}\n  .hint{font-size:12px;color:#64748b}\n  canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:520px;border-radius:14px;background:#0d1522;\n         touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair;}\n  .readouts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:8px}\n  .stat{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:8px 10px;overflow:hidden}\n  .stat .k{display:block;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:700}\n  .stat .val{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n             font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;margin-top:2px;\n             white-space:nowrap}\n  .stat.u .val{color:#0891b2}\n  .stat.v .val{color:#7c3aed}\n  .stat.det .val{color:#334155}\n  .stat.aa .val{color:#b45309}\n  .stat.bb .val{color:#047857}\n  .status{border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;\n          border:1px solid transparent;transition:background .2s,color .2s,border-color .2s}\n  .status.ok{background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;border-color:#a7f3d0}\n  .status.warn{background:#fffbeb;color:#92400e;border-color:#fde68a}\n  .status.bad{background:#fef2f2;color:#991b1b;border-color:#fecaca}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <button data-preset=\"axes\">axes</button>\n    <button data-preset=\"perp\">perpendicular, unequal length</button>\n    <button data-preset=\"slanted\">slanted</button>\n    <button data-preset=\"parallel\">parallel</button>\n    <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n    <span class=\"hint\">drag the tips of <b>u</b>, <b>v</b> and the point <b>p</b></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n\n  <div class=\"readouts\">\n    <div class=\"stat u\"><span class=\"k\">u</span><span class=\"val\" id=\"outU\">(1.00, 2.00)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat v\"><span class=\"k\">v</span><span class=\"val\" id=\"outV\">(3.00, 1.00)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat det\"><span class=\"k\">det = u<sub>x</sub>v<sub>y</sub> − u<sub>y</sub>v<sub>x</sub></span><span class=\"val\" id=\"outDet\">−5.00</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat aa\"><span class=\"k\">a&nbsp;&nbsp;(p = a·u + b·v)</span><span class=\"val\" id=\"outA\">1.00</span></div>\n    <div class=\"stat bb\"><span class=\"k\">b</span><span class=\"val\" id=\"outB\">1.00</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"status\" class=\"status ok\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\n\nvar cv  = document.getElementById('cv');\nvar ctx = cv.getContext('2d');\nvar outU = document.getElementById('outU');\nvar outV = document.getElementById('outV');\nvar outDet = document.getElementById('outDet');\nvar outA = document.getElementById('outA');\nvar outB = document.getElementById('outB');\nvar statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n\nvar u = {x:1, y:2};\nvar v = {x:3, y:1};\nvar p = {x:4, y:3};\n\nvar CU = '#38bdf8';       // u colour\nvar CV = '#c084fc';       // v colour\nvar CA = '#fbbf24';       // a·u leg\nvar CB = '#34d399';       // b·v leg\n\nvar ZERO_EPS = 0.02;      // |det| below this = collapse\nvar NEAR_EPS = 0.30;      // |det| below this = nearly parallel\n\nvar W = 800, H = 520, scale = 50, cx = 400, cy = 260;\nvar world = {x0:-8, x1:8, y0:-5, y1:5};\n\n/* ---------- coordinate helpers ---------- */\nfunction sx(x){ return cx + x*scale; }\nfunction sy(y){ return cy - y*scale; }\nfunction toWorld(px, py){ return {x:(px-cx)/scale, y:(cy-py)/scale}; }\nfunction clamp(n,a,b){ return n<a?a:(n>b?b:n); }\n\nfunction resize(){\n  var r = cv.getBoundingClientRect();\n  var dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n  W = Math.max(1, Math.round(r.width));\n  H = Math.max(1, Math.round(r.height));\n  cv.width  = Math.round(W*dpr);\n  cv.height = Math.round(H*dpr);\n  ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);\n  cx = W/2; cy = H/2;\n  scale = Math.min(W/16, H/10);\n  world = {\n    x0: -cx/scale,\n    x1: (W-cx)/scale,\n    y0: -(H-cy)/scale,\n    y1: cy/scale\n  };\n  render();\n}\n\n/* ---------- solver ---------- */\nfunction solve(){\n  var det = u.x*v.y - u.y*v.x;\n  var ad = Math.abs(det);\n  var status = ad < ZERO_EPS ? 'bad' : (ad < NEAR_EPS ? 'warn' : 'ok');\n  if(status === 'bad'){\n    var lu = Math.hypot(u.x, u.y);\n    var onLine = lu > 1e-9 && (Math.abs(u.x*p.y - u.y*p.x)/lu) < 0.05;\n    return {det:det, status:status, a:null, b:null, onLine:onLine};\n  }\n  return {\n    det: det,\n    status: status,\n    a: (p.x*v.y - p.y*v.x)/det,\n    b: (u.x*p.y - u.y*p.x)/det,\n    onLine: false\n  };\n}\n\n/* ---------- text helpers ---------- */\nfunction label(text, X, Y, color, size, weight){\n  ctx.font = (weight||700) + ' ' + (size||14) + 'px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif';\n  ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n  ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n  ctx.lineJoin = 'round';\n  ctx.lineWidth = 4.5;\n  ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(13,21,34,0.92)';\n  ctx.strokeText(text, X, Y);\n  ctx.fillStyle = color;\n  ctx.fillText(text, X, Y);\n}\n\n/* ---------- primitives ---------- */\nfunction seg(a, b, color, w, dash){\n  ctx.save();\n  if(dash) ctx.setLineDash(dash);\n  ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n  ctx.lineWidth = w;\n  ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(sx(a.x), sy(a.y));\n  ctx.lineTo(sx(b.x), sy(b.y));\n  ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction clipLine(P, d, rect){\n  var t0 = -Infinity, t1 = Infinity, ta, tb, tmp;\n  if(Math.abs(d.x) < 1e-12){\n    if(P.x < rect.x0 || P.x > rect.x1) return null;\n  } else {\n    ta = (rect.x0 - P.x)/d.x;\n    tb = (rect.x1 - P.x)/d.x;\n    if(ta > tb){ tmp = ta; ta = tb; tb = tmp; }\n    if(ta > t0) t0 = ta;\n    if(tb < t1) t1 = tb;\n  }\n  if(Math.abs(d.y) < 1e-12){\n    if(P.y < rect.y0 || P.y > rect.y1) return null;\n  } else {\n    ta = (rect.y0 - P.y)/d.y;\n    tb = (rect.y1 - P.y)/d.y;\n    if(ta > tb){ tmp = ta; ta = tb; tb = tmp; }\n    if(ta > t0) t0 = ta;\n    if(tb < t1) t1 = tb;\n  }\n  if(t0 > t1) return null;\n  return [\n    {x: P.x + t0*d.x, y: P.y + t0*d.y},\n    {x: P.x + t1*d.x, y: P.y + t1*d.y}\n  ];\n}\n\n/* ---------- drawing ---------- */\nfunction drawBackground(){\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#0d1522';\n  ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n}\n\nfunction drawSquareGrid(){\n  var i, X, Y;\n  ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n  var i0 = Math.floor(world.x0), i1 = Math.ceil(world.x1);\n  for(i=i0;i<=i1;i++){\n    X = Math.round(sx(i)) + 0.5;\n    ctx.strokeStyle = (i % 5 === 0) ? 'rgba(148,163,184,0.16)' : 'rgba(148,163,184,0.075)';\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(X,0); ctx.lineTo(X,H); ctx.stroke();\n  }\n  var j0 = Math.floor(world.y0), j1 = Math.ceil(world.y1);\n  for(i=j0;i<=j1;i++){\n    Y = Math.round(sy(i)) + 0.5;\n    ctx.strokeStyle = (i % 5 === 0) ? 'rgba(148,163,184,0.16)' : 'rgba(148,163,184,0.075)';\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,Y); ctx.lineTo(W,Y); ctx.stroke();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction drawAxes(){\n  var X0 = sx(0), Y0 = sy(0), i, X, Y;\n  ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(203,213,225,0.32)';\n  ctx.lineWidth = 1.2;\n  if(X0 >= -2 && X0 <= W+2){\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(Math.round(X0)+0.5,0); ctx.lineTo(Math.round(X0)+0.5,H); ctx.stroke();\n  }\n  if(Y0 >= -2 && Y0 <= H+2){\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,Math.round(Y0)+0.5); ctx.lineTo(W,Math.round(Y0)+0.5); ctx.stroke();\n  }\n\n  ctx.font = '500 10px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace';\n  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(148,163,184,0.8)';\n  ctx.textAlign = 'center'; ctx.textBaseline = 'top';\n  ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(203,213,225,0.4)';\n  ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n  for(i=Math.ceil(world.x0); i<=Math.floor(world.x1); i++){\n    if(i === 0) continue;\n    X = sx(i);\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(X, Y0-3.5); ctx.lineTo(X, Y0+3.5); ctx.stroke();\n    if(i % 2 === 0 && Y0 > 10 && Y0 < H-14) ctx.fillText(String(i), X, Y0+6);\n  }\n  ctx.textAlign = 'right'; ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n  for(i=Math.ceil(world.y0); i<=Math.floor(world.y1); i++){\n    if(i === 0) continue;\n    Y = sy(i);\n    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(X0-3.5, Y); ctx.lineTo(X0+3.5, Y); ctx.stroke();\n    if(i % 2 === 0 && X0 > 16 && X0 < W-6) ctx.fillText(String(i), X0-7, Y);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction drawFamily(stack, dir, rgb){\n  var L = Math.hypot(dir.x, dir.y);\n  if(L < 1e-9) return;\n  var nx = -dir.y/L, ny = dir.x/L;\n  var dn = stack.x*nx + stack.y*ny;\n\n  var cs = [[world.x0,world.y0],[world.x1,world.y0],[world.x0,world.y1],[world.x1,world.y1]];\n  var mn = Infinity, mx = -Infinity, o, i;\n  for(i=0;i<4;i++){\n    o = cs[i][0]*nx + cs[i][1]*ny;\n    if(o < mn) mn = o;\n    if(o > mx) mx = o;\n  }\n\n  var ks = [], k;\n  if(Math.abs(dn) < 1e-7){\n    ks = [0];\n  } else {\n    var t1 = mn/dn, t2 = mx/dn;\n    var lo = Math.min(t1,t2), hi = Math.max(t1,t2);\n    var k0 = Math.floor(lo) - 1, k1 = Math.ceil(hi) + 1;\n    if(k1 - k0 > 400) k1 = k0 + 400;\n    for(k=k0;k<=k1;k++) ks.push(k);\n  }\n\n  for(i=0;i<ks.length;i++){\n    k = ks[i];\n    var P = {x: stack.x*k, y: stack.y*k};\n    var sg = clipLine(P, dir, world);\n    if(!sg) continue;\n    var major = (k === 0);\n    ctx.strokeStyle = major ? (rgb + '0.62)') : (rgb + '0.20)');\n    ctx.lineWidth = major ? 1.9 : 1;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(sx(sg[0].x), sy(sg[0].y));\n    ctx.lineTo(sx(sg[1].x), sy(sg[1].y));\n    ctx.stroke();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction drawLatticeLines(){\n  drawFamily(v, u, 'rgba(56,189,248,');   // lines {t·u + k·v}\n  drawFamily(u, v, 'rgba(192,132,252,');  // lines {k·u + t·v}\n}\n\nfunction drawLatticeDots(){\n  var det = u.x*v.y - u.y*v.x;\n  var ad = Math.abs(det);\n  var lu = Math.hypot(u.x,u.y), lv = Math.hypot(v.x,v.y);\n  if(lu < 1e-6 || lv < 1e-6) return;\n\n  var diag = Math.hypot(world.x1-world.x0, world.y1-world.y0);\n  var imax = Math.min(70, Math.ceil(diag*lv/(2*Math.max(ad,1e-9))) + 2);\n  var jmax = Math.min(70, Math.ceil(diag*lu/(2*Math.max(ad,1e-9))) + 2);\n  var padx = 0.2, pady = 0.2;\n\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  for(var i=-imax;i<=imax;i++){\n    var ax = i*u.x, ay = i*u.y;\n    for(var j=-jmax;j<=jmax;j++){\n      var x = ax + j*v.x;\n      if(x < world.x0-padx || x > world.x1+padx) continue;\n      var y = ay + j*v.y;\n      if(y < world.y0-pady || y > world.y1+pady) continue;\n      var X = sx(x), Y = sy(y);\n      ctx.moveTo(X + 1.9, Y);\n      ctx.arc(X, Y, 1.9, 0, 6.2831853);\n    }\n  }\n  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(226,232,240,0.5)';\n  ctx.fill();\n}\n\nfunction arrow(from, to, color, width, name){\n  var x0 = sx(from.x), y0 = sy(from.y), x1 = sx(to.x), y1 = sy(to.y);\n  var ang = Math.atan2(y1-y0, x1-x0);\n  var len = Math.hypot(x1-x0, y1-y0);\n  var head = Math.min(13, Math.max(7, len*0.24));\n\n  ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n  ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n  ctx.lineWidth = width;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(x0,y0);\n  ctx.lineTo(x1 - Math.cos(ang)*head*0.85, y1 - Math.sin(ang)*head*0.85);\n  ctx.stroke();\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = color;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(x1, y1);\n  ctx.lineTo(x1 - Math.cos(ang-0.42)*head, y1 - Math.sin(ang-0.42)*head);\n  ctx.lineTo(x1 - Math.cos(ang+0.42)*head, y1 - Math.sin(ang+0.42)*head);\n  ctx.closePath();\n  ctx.fill();\n\n  // draggable handle ring\n  ctx.save();\n  ctx.globalAlpha = 0.85;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(x1, y1, 8.5, 0, 6.2831853);\n  ctx.strokeStyle = color;\n  ctx.lineWidth = 1.6;\n  ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.restore();\n\n  label(name, x1 + Math.cos(ang)*19, y1 + Math.sin(ang)*19, color, 15);\n}\n\nfunction drawVectors(){\n  arrow({x:0,y:0}, u, CU, 3, 'u');\n  arrow({x:0,y:0}, v, CV, 3, 'v');\n}\n\nfunction legLabel(text, P, Q, color){\n  var x1 = sx(P.x), y1 = sy(P.y), x2 = sx(Q.x), y2 = sy(Q.y);\n  var mx = (x1+x2)/2, my = (y1+y2)/2;\n  var dx = x2-x1, dy = y2-y1;\n  var L = Math.hypot(dx,dy) || 1;\n  var nx = -dy/L, ny = dx/L;\n  var px = sx(p.x), py = sy(p.y);\n  if((mx-px)*nx + (my-py)*ny < 0){ nx = -nx; ny = -ny; }\n  label(text, mx + nx*15, my + ny*15, color, 13.5);\n}\n\nfunction drawSolution(sol){\n  var O = {x:0, y:0};\n\n  if(sol.status === 'bad'){\n    if(sol.onLine){\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      ctx.arc(sx(p.x), sy(p.y), 20, 0, 6.2831853);\n      ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(248,113,113,0.55)';\n      ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n      ctx.setLineDash([4,4]);\n      ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);\n    }\n    return;\n  }\n\n  var A = {x: sol.a*u.x, y: sol.a*u.y};\n  var B = {x: sol.b*v.x, y: sol.b*v.y};\n\n  // translucent parallelogram fill\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(sx(O.x), sy(O.y));\n  ctx.lineTo(sx(A.x), sy(A.y));\n  ctx.lineTo(sx(p.x), sy(p.y));\n  ctx.lineTo(sx(B.x), sy(B.y));\n  ctx.closePath();\n  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(148,163,184,0.10)';\n  ctx.fill();\n\n  // dashed completion sides\n  seg(A, p, 'rgba(226,232,240,0.32)', 1.4, [5,5]);\n  seg(p, B, 'rgba(226,232,240,0.32)', 1.4, [5,5]);\n\n  // the two spanning legs\n  seg(O, A, CA, 3.2);\n  seg(O, B, CB, 3.2);\n\n  // corner markers\n  ctx.fillStyle = CA;\n  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(sx(A.x), sy(A.y), 4, 0, 6.2831853); ctx.fill();\n  ctx.fillStyle = CB;\n  ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(sx(B.x), sy(B.y), 4, 0, 6.2831853); ctx.fill();\n\n  legLabel('a·u', O, A, CA);\n  legLabel('b·v', O, B, CB);\n}\n\nfunction drawTarget(){\n  var X = sx(p.x), Y = sy(p.y);\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(X, Y, 14, 0, 6.2831853);\n  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)';\n  ctx.fill();\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(X, Y, 7, 0, 6.2831853);\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n  ctx.fill();\n  ctx.strokeStyle = '#0d1522';\n  ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n  ctx.stroke();\n  label('p', X + 18, Y - 15, '#ffffff', 15);\n}\n\nfunction drawOrigin(){\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(sx(0), sy(0), 3.2, 0, 6.2831853);\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#e2e8f0';\n  ctx.fill();\n}\n\n/* ---------- readouts ---------- */\nfunction f(n){\n  var s = n.toFixed(2);\n  if(s === '-0.00') s = '0.00';\n  return s;\n}\n\nfunction updateReadouts(sol){\n  outU.textContent = '(' + f(u.x) + ', ' + f(u.y) + ')';\n  outV.textContent = '(' + f(v.x) + ', ' + f(v.y) + ')';\n  outDet.textContent = f(sol.det);\n\n  if(sol.status === 'bad'){\n    if(sol.onLine){\n      outA.textContent = '∞';\n      outB.textContent = '∞';\n    } else {\n      outA.textContent = '—';\n      outB.textContent = '—';\n    }\n  } else {\n    outA.textContent = f(sol.a);\n    outB.textContent = f(sol.b);\n  }\n\n  if(sol.status === 'ok'){\n    statusEl.className = 'status ok';\n    statusEl.textContent = 'non-parallel directions: every point in the plane has exactly one recipe (a, b)';\n  } else if(sol.status === 'warn'){\n    statusEl.className = 'status warn';\n    statusEl.textContent = 'nearly parallel — the recipes exist but the weights a, b are exploding';\n  } else {\n    statusEl.className = 'status bad';\n    statusEl.textContent = 'the directions lie on one line: a point on that line has infinitely many recipes, a point off it has none';\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---------- main render ---------- */\nfunction render(){\n  var sol = solve();\n  drawBackground();\n  drawSquareGrid();\n  drawAxes();\n  drawLatticeLines();\n  drawLatticeDots();\n  drawSolution(sol);\n  drawVectors();\n  drawOrigin();\n  drawTarget();\n  updateReadouts(sol);\n}\n\nvar pending = false;\nfunction scheduleRender(){\n  if(pending) return;\n  pending = true;\n  requestAnimationFrame(function(){ pending = false; render(); });\n}\n\n/* ---------- animation ---------- */\nvar animToken = 0;\nfunction animateTo(tu, tv){\n  var token = ++animToken;\n  var fu = {x:u.x, y:u.y}, fv = {x:v.x, y:v.y};\n  var t0 = performance.now();\n  var dur = 620;\n  function step(now){\n    if(token !== animToken) return;\n    var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0)/dur);\n    var e = t < 0.5 ? 2*t*t : 1 - Math.pow(-2*t + 2, 2)/2;\n    u.x = fu.x + (tu.x - fu.x)*e;\n    u.y = fu.y + (tu.y - fu.y)*e;\n    v.x = fv.x + (tv.x - fv.x)*e;\n    v.y = fv.y + (tv.y - fv.y)*e;\n    render();\n    if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(step);\n}\n\nvar PRESETS = {\n  axes:     {u:{x:1, y:0}, v:{x:0, y:1}},\n  perp:     {u:{x:2, y:0}, v:{x:0, y:1}},\n  slanted:  {u:{x:1, y:2}, v:{x:3, y:1}},\n  parallel: {u:{x:1, y:2}, v:{x:2, y:4}}\n};\n\nvar buttons = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('button[data-preset]'));\nbuttons.forEach(function(btn){\n  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    var pre = PRESETS[btn.getAttribute('data-preset')];\n    if(!pre) return;\n    buttons.forEach(function(b){ b.classList.remove('on'); });\n    btn.classList.add('on');\n    animateTo(pre.u, pre.v);\n  });\n});\n\n/* ---------- dragging ---------- */\nvar drag = null;\n\nfunction mousePos(e){\n  var r = cv.getBoundingClientRect();\n  return {x: e.clientX - r.left, y: e.clientY - r.top};\n}\n\nfunction handleAt(mx, my){\n  var cands = [\n    {id:'u', X: sx(u.x), Y: sy(u.y)},\n    {id:'v', X: sx(v.x), Y: sy(v.y)},\n    {id:'p', X: sx(p.x), Y: sy(p.y)}\n  ];\n  var best = null, bestD = 20;\n  for(var i=0;i<cands.length;i++){\n    var d = Math.hypot(cands[i].X - mx, cands[i].Y - my);\n    if(d < bestD){ bestD = d; best = cands[i].id; }\n  }\n  return best;\n}\n\ncv.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n  var m = mousePos(e);\n  var h = handleAt(m.x, m.y);\n  if(!h) return;\n  drag = h;\n  animToken++;\n  buttons.forEach(function(b){ b.classList.remove('on'); });\n  try { cv.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err) {}\n  cv.style.cursor = 'grabbing';\n  e.preventDefault();\n});\n\ncv.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n  var m = mousePos(e);\n  if(drag){\n    var w = toWorld(m.x, m.y);\n    var nx = clamp(w.x, world.x0 + 0.35, world.x1 - 0.35);\n    var ny = clamp(w.y, world.y0 + 0.35, world.y1 - 0.35);\n\n    if(drag === 'u' || drag === 'v'){\n      var L = Math.hypot(nx, ny);\n      if(L < 0.45){\n        if(L < 1e-6){ nx = 0.45; ny = 0; }\n        else { nx = nx/L*0.45; ny = ny/L*0.45; }\n      }\n      var tgt = (drag === 'u') ? u : v;\n      tgt.x = nx; tgt.y = ny;\n    } else {\n      p.x = nx; p.y = ny;\n    }\n    scheduleRender();\n  } else {\n    cv.style.cursor = handleAt(m.x, m.y) ? 'grab' : 'crosshair';\n  }\n});\n\nfunction endDrag(e){\n  if(!drag) return;\n  drag = null;\n  cv.style.cursor = 'crosshair';\n  try { cv.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err) {}\n  scheduleRender();\n}\ncv.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\ncv.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\ncv.addEventListener('pointerleave', function(){ if(!drag) cv.style.cursor = 'crosshair'; });\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n/* start with the \"slanted\" preset highlighted */\nbuttons.forEach(function(b){\n  if(b.getAttribute('data-preset') === 'slanted') b.classList.add('on');\n});\n\nresize();\nwindow.requestAnimationFrame(function(){ resize(); });\n\n/* expose a little state for automated probing */\nwindow.__demo = {\n  get det(){ return u.x*v.y - u.y*v.x; },\n  setU: function(x,y){ u.x=x; u.y=y; render(); },\n  setV: function(x,y){ v.x=x; v.y=y; render(); },\n  setP: function(x,y){ p.x=x; p.y=y; render(); },\n  solve: solve,\n  render: render\n};\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
		"tested": true,
		"notes": "Done — the demo is built and every run passed.\n\n**Notes:** \"Slanted coordinate grids\" draws a dark 2D plane with a faint square grid for reference, two draggable arrow vectors **u** and **v**, and a draggable target **p**. As you drag a tip, the two families of lattice lines and the integer lattice dots shear live, and the shaded parallelogram (origin → a·u → p → b·v) with labelled amber **a·u** and green **b·v** legs always keeps p at exactly one corner — the (a, b) recipe updates continuously in the readout strip. The status bar is a three-state traffic light driven by |det| (green = unique recipe, amber = nearly parallel with exploding weights, red = collapsed, where a, b show \"—\" for off-line points or \"∞\" on the line). The four preset buttons (axes / perpendicular, unequal length / slanted / parallel) tween the vectors over ~0.6 s so learners can watch the square grid turn into a parallelogram and then collapse. Try: hold the \"slanted\" preset and drag **v** slowly toward the direction of **u** to watch a and b blow up and the status go amber, then red."
